wildos-files (0.1.8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Renaming in place works like Explorer: the arrow keys move within the
    name and never end the rename, and the name keeps its normal colour
    while selected. Enter or clicking away keeps it, Escape undoes it.
  * Open containing folder in Pictures, and Show in folder in other apps,
    work for files with spaces in their names and bring Files to the front.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:26:26 +0000

wildos-files (0.1.7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Show in folder works again, in Brave downloads, file dialogs, Capture
    and other apps. Kicksecure's stand-in for the old LXQt file manager had
    been taking the request first and dropping it; it now stands aside while
    Files is installed.
  * Apps asking Files to show a location are limited to local files and
    folders that exist. A file is always shown selected in its folder, never
    opened, and addresses on other computers or with hidden characters are
    ignored.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:15:00 +0000

