wildos-files (0.1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Right-clicking an archive (ZIP, 7z, RAR, TAR, GZ and the like) offers
    Extract here, which unpacks it beside itself in Archive: into a folder
    named after it, or straight in when it holds a single folder.
  * Compress... beside Compress to ZIP file opens Archive's New archive
    with what is selected, to pick the name, ZIP or 7z, and the folder.

